---
                                                                                                    
  Configuration                                                                                     
  Toggle TUI settings (changes saved to config.toml)                                                
                                                                                                    
  ▏› 1. Pinned Plan Drawer (off)                                                                 ▕  
  ▏     Pin plan updates to a drawer in the viewport instead of history                          ▕  
     2. Thoughts in History (on)                                                                    
        Show agent thoughts in history, not only in the working indicator                           
     3. Resize Reflow (on)                                                                          
        Reflow transcript history when the terminal width changes                                   
     4. Custom Working Messages (on)                                                                
        Rotate playful status messages while the agent is working                                   
     5. Vertical Footer (off)                                                                       
        Stack footer segments vertically instead of horizontally                                    
     6. Terminal Notifications (on)                                                                 
        Send OSC 9 escape sequences to notify the terminal on events                                
     7. OS Notifications (on)                                                                       
        Send native desktop notifications on events                                                 
     8. Vim Mode (off)                                                                              
        Enable vim-style navigation in the textarea (Escape enters normal mode)                     
  ↑↓/j/k move  / search  enter select  esc close
